  "body": "  It's Black Friday and the Nintendo Switch you'be been saving up for is marked down to 60% of its original price! Construct a block of code that calculates how much money you'd be saving if the system originally costed $359.99?     int main() {     double game = 359.99;    double game = $359.99;      double discount = game * 0.60;    double discount = game - (0.60 * game);      double moneySaved = game - discount;    double moneySaved = discount;     double moneySaved = game + discount;    }    "
