  "body": "  What is the return type of main?       void    What keyword do we use before main() in every program?      bool    What keyword do we use before main() in every program?      double    What keyword do we use before main() in every program?      int    Yes, main is supposed to return an integer, which is why programmers often return 0 at the end of main .    "
