  "body": "  Construct a function that takes in three Point structures and prints the average of the x coordinates and the average of the y coordinates as a coordinate. Find the x average before the y average.     void printAveragePoint(Point p1, Point p2, Point p3) {    double avgX = (p1.x + p2.x + p3.x)\/3;    double avgY = (p1.y + p2.y + p3.y)\/3;    double avgY = (y.p1 + y.p2 + y.p3)\/3;    std::cout << \"(\" << avgX << \",\" << avgY << \")\";    std::cout << \"(\" << \"avgX\" << \",\" << \"avgY\" << \")\";    }    "
