  "body": "   Let's write the code for the printTime function. printTime should print out the time in the HOUR:MINUTE:SECONDS format.      void printTime(Time& time) {    Time printTime(Time& time) {      std::cout << time.hour << \":\" << time.minute << \":\" << time.second;    std::cout << hour << \":\" << minute << \":\" << second;     }     "
