  "body": "  Write the function printInfo , which prints the music album's information in the format This is a artist , year album with\/without featured artists. If artist has the value n\/a , printInfo prints out Unknown artist ! Your album is from year .   #include <iostream> struct Music { std::string artist; int year; bool has_featured; }; \/\/ Write your code for the printInfo function here. int main() { Music m1 = { \"n\/a\", 2007, true }; printInfo(m1); Cake c2 = { \"Drake\", 2016, false }; printInfo(m2); }    Below is one way to implement the program.  #include <iostream> struct Music { std::string artist; int year; bool has_featured; }; void printInfo(Music m) { if (m.artist == \"n\/a\") { std::cout << \"Unknown artist! Your album is from \" << m.year << \".\" << std::endl; } else { if (m.has_featured == true) { std::cout << \"This is a \" << m.artist << \", \" << m.year << \" album with featured artists.\" << std::endl; } if (m.has_featured == false) { std::cout << \"This is a \" << m.artist << \", \" << m.year << \" album without featured artists.\" << std::endl; } } } int main() { Music m1 = { \"n\/a\", 2007, true }; printInfo(m1); Music m2 = { \"Drake\", 2016, false }; printInfo(m2); }   "
